{% comment %}
================================================================
NEXABRAND USA™ — PRODUCT PAGE TEMPLATE
File: templates/product.liquid  (applies to all 5 products)
   OR create specific templates:
      templates/product.essential.liquid
      templates/product.day-mask.liquid
      templates/product.night-mask.liquid  ← DARK HERO ONLY
      templates/product.hydroclear-36.liquid
      templates/product.hydroclear-72.liquid

SECTION ORDER (all 5 products):
  1.  Product hero — two column layout
  2.  Full description + benefits + ingredients + how to use
  3.  Before / After slider
  4.  UGC Video
  5.  Text Reviews (Loox)
  6.  Key Ingredients illustration grid
  7.  Why NexaBeauty vs Others — comparison table
  8.  Subscribe & Save — Coming Soon
  9.  FAQ
  10. Sticky add-to-cart bar

NIGHT MASK DIFFERENCE:
  — Hero uses dark gradient: linear-gradient(155deg, #1A3A42 0%, #2d6b7a 50%, #4AACBF 100%)
  — Product name color: #F0F9FB
  — Tagline color: #B9E8F5
  — Price color: #FFFFFF
  — All other sections are identical
================================================================
{% endcomment %}

{% comment %} ---- PRODUCT HERO SECTION ---- {% endcomment %}
<div class="nb-product-hero {% if product.tags contains 'night-mask' %}nb-product-hero--night{% endif %}">

  <!-- LEFT: Images 44% -->
  <div class="nb-product-hero__images">
    <div class="nb-product-hero__main-image">
      {{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 600 | image_tag: loading: 'eager' }}
    </div>
    <div class="nb-product-hero__thumbs">
      {% for image in product.images limit: 4 %}
        <div class="nb-product-hero__thumb">
          {{ image | image_url: width: 200 | image_tag }}
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div style="font-size:11px;color:{% if product.tags contains 'night-mask' %}#B9E8F5{% else %}#888{% endif %};margin-top:8px;text-align:center">
      3D Box · Close-up · On-Skin · Lifestyle
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- RIGHT: Details 56% -->
  <div class="nb-product-hero__details">

    {% comment %} Value badge for 72ct only {% endcomment %}
    {% if product.tags contains '72ct' %}
      <div class="nb-value-badge">Best Value — Save 40% vs 36ct</div>
    {% endif %}

    <h1 class="nb-product-hero__name">{{ product.title }}</h1>

    {% comment %} Tagline from metafield or product tag {% endcomment %}
    <div class="nb-product-hero__tagline">{{ product.metafields.custom.tagline }}</div>

    {% comment %} Subtitle for masks only {% endcomment %}
    {% if product.tags contains 'day-mask' %}
      <div class="nb-product-hero__subtitle">Infused with Marine Collagen for Brightening Glow</div>
    {% elsif product.tags contains 'night-mask' %}
      <div class="nb-product-hero__subtitle">Infused with Marine Collagen for Plumping Glow</div>
    {% endif %}

    {% comment %} Price {% endcomment %}
    <div class="nb-product-hero__price">
      {% if product.tags contains '72ct' %}
        {{ product.price | money }} <span style="font-size:16px;color:#888;text-decoration:line-through;font-weight:400">$25.98</span>
      {% else %}
        {{ product.price | money }}
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    {% comment %} Trust badges {% endcomment %}
    <div class="nb-product-hero__badges">
      {% if product.tags contains 'patch' %}
        <span class="nb-product-hero__badge">✓ ISO 13485 Medical-Grade</span>
        <span class="nb-product-hero__badge">✓ Vegan Formula</span>
        <span class="nb-product-hero__badge">✓ Suitable for Sensitive Skin</span>
      {% else %}
        <span class="nb-product-hero__badge">✓ GMP Certified Manufacturing</span>
        <span class="nb-product-hero__badge">✓ K-Beauty Inspired Formula</span>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    {% comment %} Buy buttons {% endcomment %}
    <div class="nb-product-hero__buttons">
      {% if product.metafields.custom.amazon_url != blank %}
        <a href="{{ product.metafields.custom.amazon_url }}" class="nb-product-hero__amazon" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          Buy on Amazon
        </a>
      {% endif %}
      {% form 'product', product %}
        <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}">
        <button type="submit" class="nb-product-hero__cart">Add to Cart</button>
      {% endform %}
    </div>

    {% if product.tags contains '72ct' %}
      <p class="nb-product-hero__supply-note">1–2 month supply · Most popular choice</p>
    {% endif %}

  </div>
</div>


{% comment %} ---- DESCRIPTION SECTION ---- {% endcomment %}
<div class="nb-product-desc">
  {{ product.description }}
  <div class="nb-product-desc__brand">K-Beauty Inspired · Developed by NexaBrand USA™</div>
</div>


{% comment %}
NOTE: Product descriptions should be entered in Shopify admin
with this HTML structure:

<p>[Opening paragraph about the product]</p>
<p>[Second paragraph about formulation]</p>
<p>[Skin type / suitability paragraph]</p>

<div class="nb-product-desc__section-title">Key Benefits</div>
<ul>
  <li>[Benefit 1]</li>
  <li>[Benefit 2]</li>
  <li>[Benefit 3]</li>
  <li>[Benefit 4]</li>
</ul>

<div class="nb-product-desc__section-title">Hero Ingredients</div>
<ul>
  <li>[Ingredient] — [benefit]</li>
</ul>

<div class="nb-product-desc__section-title">How to Use</div>

ALL 5 PRODUCTS use ✦ sparkle symbol — no bullets, no numbers:

FOR SERUM:
<div class="nb-product-desc__steps">
  <p>✦ Apply 2–3 drops to cleansed skin</p>
  <p>✦ Gently pat until fully absorbed</p>
  <p>✦ Use morning and evening</p>
</div>

FOR MASKS:
<div class="nb-product-desc__steps">
  <p>✦ Cleanse and tone your face</p>
  <p>✦ Remove mask from pouch and unfold carefully</p>
  <p>✦ Apply evenly to face, adjusting around eyes and nose</p>
  <p>✦ Leave on for 45–60 minutes or until the mask becomes transparent</p>
  <p>✦ For best results, apply the mask and relax in a reclined position to allow full adherence and absorption</p>
  <p>✦ Remove mask and gently massage remaining essence into skin</p>
  <p>✦ Apply remaining essence to face, neck, and body — no rinsing needed</p>
</div>

FOR PATCHES:
<div class="nb-product-desc__steps">
  <p>✦ Cleanse and dry the affected area completely</p>
  <p>✦ Peel and apply patch directly over the blemish</p>
  <p>✦ Remove after 6–8 hours or when the patch turns white</p>
</div>

{% endcomment %}


{% comment %} ---- BEFORE / AFTER SECTION ---- {% endcomment %}
<div class="nb-before-after">
  <h2 class="nb-before-after__title">Before & After Results</h2>
  <p class="nb-before-after__sub">
    {% if product.tags contains 'patch' %}Real blemish results — slide to compare
    {% elsif product.tags contains 'mask' %}Real overnight skin transformation
    {% else %}Real customer skin transformation — 4 weeks of daily use{% endif %}
  </p>
  <div class="nb-before-after__cols">
    <div class="nb-before-after__col">
      <div class="nb-before-after__img">
        {% comment %}Replace with real before image{% endcomment %}
        <img src="{{ 'before-placeholder.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Before" loading="lazy">
      </div>
      <span class="nb-before-after__label">Before</span>
    </div>
    <div class="nb-before-after__divider"></div>
    <div class="nb-before-after__col">
      <div class="nb-before-after__img">
        {% comment %}Replace with real mid image{% endcomment %}
        <img src="{{ 'mid-placeholder.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="During" loading="lazy">
      </div>
      <span class="nb-before-after__label">
        {% if product.tags contains 'patch' %}6 Hours
        {% elsif product.tags contains 'mask' %}45 Min
        {% else %}2 Weeks{% endif %}
      </span>
    </div>
    <div class="nb-before-after__divider"></div>
    <div class="nb-before-after__col">
      <div class="nb-before-after__img">
        {% comment %}Replace with real after image{% endcomment %}
        <img src="{{ 'after-placeholder.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="After" loading="lazy">
      </div>
      <span class="nb-before-after__label">
        {% if product.tags contains 'serum' %}4 Weeks
        {% else %}Next Morning{% endif %}
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="nb-before-after__note">Replace placeholders with real customer before/after photos</p>
</div>


{% comment %} ---- UGC VIDEO SECTION ---- {% endcomment %}
<div class="nb-ugc">
  <h2 class="nb-ugc__title">See It in Action</h2>
  <div class="nb-ugc__frame">
    {% if product.metafields.custom.ugc_video_url != blank %}
      <iframe
        src="{{ product.metafields.custom.ugc_video_url }}"
        class="nb-ugc__video"
        height="400"
        frameborder="0"
        allowfullscreen
        loading="lazy">
      </iframe>
    {% else %}
      <p style="color:#888;font-size:14px">Real person using product · TikTok / Instagram / YouTube · 10–20 sec · Upload via product metafield: custom.ugc_video_url</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</div>


{% comment %} ---- REVIEWS SECTION (LOOX) ---- {% endcomment %}
<div class="nb-reviews">
  <h2 class="nb-reviews__title">Customer Reviews</h2>
  {% comment %}
  LOOX WIDGET: Add Loox review widget here after installing Loox app
  Example: {{ loox_reviews_widget }}
  OR add the Loox section via Shopify theme editor
  {% endcomment %}
  <div id="looxReviews" data-product-id="{{ product.id }}"></div>
  <a href="#" class="nb-reviews__upload-link">+ Upload your photo review · Powered by Loox</a>
</div>


